{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":945196,\"title\":\"You Can't Take it With You\",\"tagline\":\"Live a glorious experience with the grandest group of human beings who ever dared to lead their own happy lives!\",\"overview\":\"A man from a family of rich snobs becomes engaged to a woman from a good-natured but decidedly eccentric family.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSLpW5kK6M27SCjIllQQbZV41ku.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qO5hwKUraUkbGs011T4mMa0FEEp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1984,\"runtime\":116,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kirk Browning\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1238017,\"name\":\"Kirk Browning\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sqqMIpAeowuV9dFVYHmgeocOGMr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1507700,\"name\":\"Ellis Rabb\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4765,\"name\":\"Jason Robards\",\"character\":\"Grandpa Martin Vanderhof\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9y0HAtWWBkB02gVzh8QDdz6UYZH.jpg\"},{\"id\":87027,\"name\":\"George Rose\",\"character\":\"Boris Kolenkhov\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fiPzQB4hks9wBJsCdi3ApBP8CoJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":10776,\"name\":\"Elizabeth Wilson\",\"character\":\"Penny Sycamore\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8jiCTMxqiL1YwPVBqo0Pe2ZOixk.jpg\"},{\"id\":10559,\"name\":\"Colleen Dewhurst\",\"character\":\"Grand Duchess Olga Katrina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rrUNC8d6lbIrZm4yCHS39bLDtL1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1320021,\"name\":\"Maureen Anderman\",\"character\":\"Alice Sycamore\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":183404,\"name\":\"Carole Androsky\",\"character\":\"Essie Carmichael\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6TaoIAEsiYLa62OPQiWDTXUKz4E.jpg\"},{\"id\":49353,\"name\":\"Jack Dodson\",\"character\":\"Paul Sycamore\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/up5rI8lGseu4wG5XIUISGgQj85G.jpg\"},{\"id\":17488,\"name\":\"Alice Drummond\",\"character\":\"Gay Wellington\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ghiQNRLEw5sTRxh4yhue3vWcOHg.jpg\"},{\"id\":2393223,\"name\":\"Wayne Elbert\",\"character\":\"Jim\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":91827,\"name\":\"Arthur French\",\"character\":\"Donald\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zfubSF4YKsG15HWQyavn3EOMe5R.jpg\"},{\"id\":2393213,\"name\":\"Christopher Foster\",\"character\":\"Ed Carmichael\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1183445,\"name\":\"Page Johnson\",\"character\":\"Man from the Department of Justice\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":73030,\"name\":\"Rosetta LeNoire\",\"character\":\"Rheba\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bI7IRVBXANRTIj65dagqEhoWXCG.jpg\"},{\"id\":26486,\"name\":\"Bill McCutcheon\",\"character\":\"Mr. De Pinna\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gznYkW1WMRFkgKn1NSPUGtzEqWY.jpg\"},{\"id\":91372,\"name\":\"Meg Mundy\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Anthony P. Kirby\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":810,\"title\":\"Shrek the Third\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4SexGGQzI26E269tfpa80MZaGV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvXxKpFGXvQJRB0nvvfURhRD3C0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the King of Far Far Away dies, Shrek and Fiona are to succede. However, Shrek wants to return to his cozy swamp and live in peace and quiet, so when he finds out there is another heir to the throne, he and Donkey set off to bring him back to rule the kingdom.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":766475,\"title\":\"See How They Run\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r3rpSAi2yukZwr9H2km0WKGODWo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cn9GQzCaeYylEV2hymVR8bskRMJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the West End of 1950s London, plans for a movie version of a smash-hit play come to an abrupt halt after a pivotal member of the crew is murdered. When world-weary Inspector Stoppard and eager rookie Constable Stalker take on the case, the two find themselves thrown into a puzzling whodunit within the glamorously sordid theater underground, investigating the mysterious homicide at their own peril.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10050,\"title\":\"Get Over It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A5cTiukvEqNuTpNFRgVTTf1aZOI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/saQxwnIr4ftRmFpJeV9DQI1lsWd.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Berke Landers, a popular high school basketball star, gets dumped by his life-long girlfriend, Allison, he soon begins to lose it. But with the help of his best friend Felix's sister Kelly, he follows his ex into the school's spring musical. Thus ensues a love triangle loosely based upon Shakespeare's \\\"A Midsummer Night's Dream\\\", where Berke is only to find himself getting over Allison and beginning to fall for Kelly.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10697,\"title\":\"The Taste of Others\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k9R6Omadvp57EoQ4x9nNneig1Nv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tcsHNAMeZubqcAEbCQHd41WvEOA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Unpolished and ultra-pragmatic industrialist Jean-Jacques Castella reluctantly attends Racine's tragedy \\\"Berenice\\\" in order to see his niece play a bit part. He is taken with the play's strangely familiar-looking leading lady Clara Devaux. During the course of the show, Castella soon remembers that he once hired and then promptly fired the actress as an English language tutor. He immediately goes out and signs up for language lessons. Thinking that he is nothing but an ill-tempered philistine with bad taste, Clara rejects him until Castella charms her off her feet.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":19103,\"title\":\"As You Like It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/628YkM5wHmunTdXANWgJEJYbFdf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cBpCtxMAViuM0uZYjD0yoRmAkgQ.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Witty, playful and utterly magical, the story is a compelling romantic adventure in which Rosalind and Orlando's celebrated courtship is played out against a backdrop of political rivalry, banishment and exile in the Forest of Arden - set in 19th-century Japan.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":848958,\"title\":\"Forever Young\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j4Nd5xfhjqFF6l3k1akFmE7y2gU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwMSnVhWcVfa769D5NbgjgPwRil.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At the end of the 1980s, Stella, Victor, Adèle and Etienne are 20 years old. They take the entrance exam to the famous acting school created by Patrice Chéreau and Pierre Romans at the Théâtre des Amandiers in Nanterre. Launched at full speed into life, passion, and love, together they will experience the turning point of their lives, but also their first tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":455795,\"title\":\"Le syndrome de l'écossais\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nXqVEmIXY1bynjXVw7QYb6ypYBr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3sBhlMed87DQNoTRFo0hpkcqusz.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bruno and Florence invited Sophie and Alex for the evening, but nothing goes as planned between the successful author, the brilliant entrepreneur and their respective wives, two sisters. Contradictions, anxieties, bad faith and pettiness come around the table. A delightful cascade of incidents quickly transforms the family reunion into a crazy night where secrets, bottles and unsaid are shattered until the two couples, caught in an irresistible whirlwind, formulate the most unexpected.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":457761,\"title\":\"Musical Chairs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vYxxdsreb2oAuyAG7GtKSPivdch.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9PdL1TBA0ZvjDD1yiBJIumiMRB6.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Victor, who lives abroad, must travel to his country of origin sent by the company where he works and will have only one day to visit his family who will do the impossible to honor him in that short stay. At that time, dramatic turns and touches of humor will occur to deep solemnities, within the traditional and beloved domestic bosom.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456735,\"title\":\"Cinema Twain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atgYsfIH9uGWre4cznTd456GN4A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8uPwLzu4EH3N3xRt4ofQMdxHOHO.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Val Kilmer, master of reinvention, becomes Mark Twain, in a funny, moving, contemporary and reflective performance, based on the life of the man who was Samuel Clemens and on his writings as Mark Twain: his thoughts on politics, his family, his faith and God… Twain shows the greatness of his incomparable wit.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10519,\"title\":\"The Flying Classroom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jI28MbNtjz9WV1NY9W7qARPNSfd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lMancq0xdjUyXtpUtzS4G3AW9mF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A boy who was once a perpetual outcast finds friends in a new boarding school. United with his new peers, he gets involved in a heated rivalry with a group of students from a neighboring school.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456190,\"title\":\"La Candidate\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3p60jikw74DmXk3av7Ibfy3srjJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r1uaIG8To5qc4K51VMTPAFcDK71.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The sequel to \\\"Panique au Ministère!\\\" Amanda Lear is back in action. And this time, she's taking us on a journey to the Élysée Palace! Cécile Bouquigny has risen through the ranks since the first installment: she is now Minister of Youth and Sports! On a whim (and three months before the end of her term!), she decides to run for president. By upsetting an already precarious balance, she once again causes panic at the Ministry...\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":718519,\"title\":\"La vie de Galilée\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78czbCdAaS6OSkNf6RjoFt8ZPJu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Accompanied by a child, the mathematician Galileo observes the firmament with a telescope. Ten years ago, the philosopher Giordano Bruno was burned in Rome for having supported the idea of an infinite and centerless universe, based on the work of Copernicus. By dint of observations and calculations, Galileo seeks proofs for his hypothesis of a cosmic system where the Earth is \\\"an ordinary celestial body, one among thousands\\\". From Padua to Venice, the mathematician shakes certainties by confronting the power of a Church which wishes to maintain its absolute power in the \\\"crystal spheres\\\" where Ptolemy has hitherto locked up the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"56IGjR63fjM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mpqxZMWCWpg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"eEsFXJjmTtM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}